EInvoiceGeneratedButRecipientNotRoutable=E-invoice generated, but the recipient cannot receive it yet, so its transmission will be blocked
EInvoiceNotSentRecipientNotRoutable=Invoice not sent: the recipient cannot receive electronic invoices
EInvoiceGeneratedButRecipientReachabilityUnconfirmed=E-invoice generated, but the recipient reachability could not be confirmed, so its transmission will be blocked
EInvoiceNotSentRecipientReachabilityUnconfirmed=Invoice not sent: the recipient reachability could not be confirmed
